  "code": "O2301 (PRACTICA 23 - DESBASTE Y ACABADO DE MEDIA ESFERA)\nG17 G21 G90 G94 G40 G49 G69 G80\n\n(1. DESBASTE DEL MATERIAL ALREDEDOR)\nT10 M06\nM03 S4500\nG54\nG43 H10 G00 Z10.0\n#120 = 52.0\nN20\nG00 X#120 Y0.0\nG01 Z-30.0 F180 M08\nG17\nG03 I[-#120] J0.0 F500\nG00 Z5.0\n#120 = [#120 - 5.0]\nIF [#120 GE 37.0] GOTO 20\nG00 Z15.0\nM09\n\n(2. ACABADO ESFERICO CON PUNTA BOLA)\nT36 M06\nM03 S6000\nG43 H36 G00 Z15.0\n#100 = 0.0      (ANGULO DEL PERFIL)\n#101 = 30.0     (RADIO DE LA ESFERA)\n#102 = 3.0      (RADIO DE LA HERRAMIENTA)\n#103 = [#101 + #102]\n#104 = [-#101 - #102]\n#105 = [#103 * COS[#100]]\n#106 = [#104 + #103 * SIN[#100]]\nG00 X#105 Y0.0\nG01 Z#106 F180 M08\n\nN100\nG17\nG03 I[-#105] J0.0 F350\n#100 = [#100 + 5.0]\nIF [#100 GT 85.0] GOTO 200\n#107 = [#103 * COS[#100]]\n#108 = [#104 + #103 * SIN[#100]]\nG18\nG03 X#107 Z#108 I[-#105] K[#104 - #106] F180\n#105 = #107\n#106 = #108\nGOTO 100\n\nN200\nG18\nG03 X0.0 Z0.0 I[-#105] K[#104 - #106] F180\nG17\nG00 Z15.0\nM05 M09\nG91 G28 Z0.0\nG90\nM30\n",
